  unitName: Talon King Rhein
  unitId: 20293
  unitNumber: 645
  description: A martial artist who escorted many civilians to El Gaia during the
    last stages of the war with the gods. After mastering the art of the Toltya Dojo,
    he fought in the frontlines at the start of the war using swift attacks. However,
    he was ordered by his dojo to protect the people making their way to El Gaia.
    Rhein accepted quietly, but it is said that he actually wanted to continue fighting
    in the frontlines. That is when he first met the soldier leading said group.
  summonDesc: I answered your calling, Summoner.<br>From now on,<br>I'll be your
    arms and legs.
  fusionDesc: I need more power<br>to help more people.<br>That's why I'm asking
    you to make me stronger.
